{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09838","headline":"寻少室张山人闻与偃师周明府同入都 · 岑参","name":"寻少室张山人闻与偃师周明府同入都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中峰链金客，昨日游人间。\n叶县凫共去，葛陂龙暂还。\n春云凑深水，秋雨悬空山。\n寂寂清谿上，空余丹竈闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}